{"id":"beehive","name":{"en":"Beehive","ja":"ハチの巣"},"desc":{"en":"A nest full of honey. The bees around here all go out to gather nectar so it's relatively safe to harvest honey.","ja":"蜜がたっぷり蓄えられた蜂蜜の巣。この地方 の蜜蜂は、全員で巣を出払っていることが多 いので、結構安全に採れる。別名働き蜂とは 呼ばれるものの、働きすぎるのも考え物だ。"},"level":1,"locations":[{"id":"alanya-area","name":{"en":"Alanya Area","ja":"アランヤ周辺地域"}},{"id":"arland-area","name":{"en":"Arland Area","ja":"アーランド周辺地域"}}],"categories":[{"id":"gunpowder","name":{"en":"(Gunpowder)","ja":"（火薬）"},"icon":"totori-category-gunpowder"},{"id":"supplement","name":{"en":"(Supplement)","ja":"（中和剤）"},"icon":"totori-category-supplement"},{"id":"vegetable","name":{"en":"(Vegetable)","ja":"（食材・野菜）"},"icon":"totori-category-vegetable"}],"item_type":"Ingredient","index":6}